    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\u0110I\u1EC0U KHI\u1EC2N\n- Ph\xEDm m\u0169i t\xEAn ho\u1EB7c ADSW: Di
    chuy\u1EC3n phi thuy\u1EC1n.\n- Gi\u1EEF Space ho\u1EB7c chu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i:
    B\u1EAFn.\n\nC\xC1CH CH\u01A0I\n- Ph\xE1 h\u1EE7y thi\xEAn th\u1EA1ch \u0111\u1EC3
    ghi \u0111i\u1EC3m.\n- Tr\xE1nh va ch\u1EA1m \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA3o to\xE0n m\xE1u.\n-
    Thu th\u1EADp sao \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn XP v\xE0 ch\u1ECDn n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p
    khi l\xEAn c\u1EA5p.\n\nM\u1EE4C TI\xCAU\n- S\u1ED1ng s\xF3t c\xE0ng l\xE2u v\xE0
    ghi c\xE0ng nhi\u1EC1u \u0111i\u1EC3m c\xE0ng t\u1ED1t!"
